{
  "name": "Qliph-Scarred (Husk): The Quiet Inside",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "art/bbttcc/GOTTGAIT/BBTTCC%20Button%20Icons/bbttcc_icons_smile_2.png",
  "system": {
    "category": "technique",
    "source": "Bad Eden Heritages v1.1 (RFI-native rules)",
    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-canon-qliph-scarred=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div><p><em>\"They looked for you in all the usual places. None of them were the right shape.\"</em></p><p><strong>The Quiet Inside (1/Soma Break).</strong> Reaction — when you are targeted by a divination, mind-reading, or truth-detection effect, force the caster to roll their effect against your Resolve instead of its normal save DC.</p><p><strong>Failure:</strong> the effect returns nothing — no partial information, no awareness that a target was present.</p><p><strong>Success:</strong> you take 1 point of Stress from the pressure of the probe.</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"qliphHuskQuietInside\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\"><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #d4b8e8; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-size: 0.78rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>The Quiet Inside</strong></span> <span style=\"opacity: 0.92; line-height: 1.4; font-size: 0.86rem\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Soma Break  ·  <strong>Action:</strong> Reaction (when probed)  ·  <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</span> <span style=\"opacity: 0.85; margin-top: 0.3rem; font-size: 0.82rem\">When divination / mind-read / truth-detect targets you, force caster to roll vs your Resolve. Fail → effect returns nothing, no detection. Success → 1 Stress.</span></p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
